A visual overhaul that improves the clarity and aesthetics of the Crusader Kings III map while using a new style.

Terrain textures, borders, water reflections and map readability have been refined to create a cleaner and less visually noisy world map. The mod focuses purely on visual improvements, making the map easier to read without altering gameplay.

[i]A subtle visual refinement rather than a complete redesign.[/i]

If you liked the mod, feel free to endorse it!

[img] https://i.imgur.com/lwrhimB.png [/img]
[list=1]
 [*]Open the [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/crusaderkings3/mods/266?tab=files]Files[/url] and select the latest version, or choose a different available version.
 [*]Download the file named [b]yb_map-*date*[/b] from the files section.
 [*]Extract the contents to the following folder: [code]%USERPROFILE%\Documents\Paradox Interactive\Crusader Kings III\mod\[/code]
[/list]

The mod folder should look something like this:

[img] https://i.imgur.com/JXIOOKs.png [/img]

[b]NOTE[/b]: When reinstalling, remove the previous [code]yb_map[/code] folder before extracting the new version to avoid leaving obsolete files behind.

[img] https://i.imgur.com/0LSDxsh.png [/img]
[list]
[*]Cleaner and simpler terrain textures
[*]Improved realm border visibility
[*]Reduced water reflections
[*]Better map font transparency
[*]A beautiful topographic-style paper map
[/list]

You can also change the paper map from the graphics settings!
[img] https://i.imgur.com/u8KjFsH.png [/img]

[img] https://i.imgur.com/Gb717mI.png [/img]
[list]
[*]Compatible with [b]1.20 "Crozier"[/b] update.
[*]Works with pre-existing saves
[*]No gameplay changes
[*]Compatible with most other mods
